<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-19T03:43:48.459Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:43:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo, the founder of the Guadalajara cartel, died at age 80 in prison, prompting massive police deployments around his hospital. Gulf Cartel plaza boss was shot by police in the capital of a border state, and Arley Pérez survived an attempted kidnapping in Sinaloa while defending narcocorridos. The United States offered a $10 million reward for information on Mexican cartel money-laundering networks, and added a new Latin American group to its foreign terrorist organization list, now totaling 22. Eduardo Flores Salado, a Mexican journalist, was killed in Acapulco. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPSW45dWs2QlRad09FcDI3Zl9Mc2wzM3hFYlFZa0toWEJiMzI1R3BSNmV0a1pIbHk0T1JBbDhQMnplbkl0RzB2OXpCVmdFdnYyd3YwN1VkWnY3ai1OTC1jZVExcG5xeXJjVC1vYjlnc054eG1xQkd6U1VnU0dDcG1MbzRKT21hVW56aURKdWJWU3E3OHQxUTVlMXNPYm9PQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNUFhCTTdINW50bVU4dFJuRi1fQWpvRXR5bHJ6LUF6bHV2MnVTaTc1MzRUbkdZbjhVRXE4Z1BWMnBOSTN0WGs0SzJ0MlAyVldZSjJ3ZHY4Z0lvTWc1elIwUi1hVzdwY1JwTGJpVFNRTjktWmZnemJVbjEwa0IzVEI4VzM1ckxUeHpHcDdOU29qaHhTSUZZY1hFZ01PT0x2bnpXZ1FKY1dqMFBLc1JmS1pYd3VnTzRoLWR2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNeTJWNlpFVlFSTFVaWTNJbzZweVA2WDg4UG8wVUVWMzBzaS1FTjI1cnowUlRaTHRYT1c5S05CTnFFd2p6dEUwUXVnNlVZZk1qYUs3bldJM0ZmZTl2YTRreDAzRzJLWUpLWlR6TmFqTEZGU20wMTZxYllDUGZsay1zQ0hTN3VaaDlzVUhpdjh0WkRZUURn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar International TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE54SmhjMGVBYkowUlVRSXJGemEtRnpWYUN3bzVmQ2RIb2d2elNEUk1iNDhJOHE1dFgyR2tsV2